SUMMARY:Artist ReLEAF - Elizabeth McCorvey
DESCRIPTION:Join us at LEAF Global Arts for our monthly Artist ReLEAF. This month’s artist is Elizabeth McCorvey.\nElizabeth is a part-time psychotherapist\, full-time musician and full-time delight. She writes original americana/folk/”bluesgrass” music about people and places that didn’t ask for her feedback.
