SUMMARY:Creative Differences Trio
DESCRIPTION:Jun 19  6:00-8:00 pm  \nCreative Differences Trio (Mike\, Pat & Heather) at Sweeten Creek Brewing.  Enjoy the picnic area while catching laid-back Americana tunes\, vocal harmonies\, multiple instruments\, percussion. Awesome craft brews & Bear’s BBQ onsite.  Indoors if rain. Easy parking\, free dog park\, even a sand box for kiddies! 1127 Sweeten Creek Rd\, Asheville
